############################
# Patch/score workflow (docs/patch_triage_2026_08_10.md rev 2):
# patches/ = instruments (dsp lane), scores/ = musical material (comp lane).
# sweep/pending/scratch are disposable working dirs; old/ is the deletion
# grace window purged >30 days by the nightly runs; library/ and baselines/
# are tracked. Renders are deleted outright (derived).
############################
patches/sweep/
patches/pending/
patches/old/
patches/scratch/
scores/sweep/
scores/pending/
scores/scratch/

